# ==============================================================================
# HemiProve Hub — Environment Configuration (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# HemiProve Hub runs ZERO-CONFIG out of the box against Hemi Sepolia (743111)
# and Hemi Mainnet (43111) public RPC + Blockscout v2 endpoints.
#
# To customize local or production deployments:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Optional Local `zkminer` CLI Binary Integration (`/api/simulate`)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When set (or when `zkminer` is available on system PATH) AND a 32-byte on-chain
# `jobId` (`0x...`) is supplied to `POST /api/simulate`, the server executes:
#   `zkminer simulate <jobId> [--po2 20]`
# and merges the live CLI report (`executionEngine: "zkminer-cli-binary"`).
# In serverless environments (e.g., Vercel) or without a local GPU worker, the
# studio automatically uses the built-in deterministic Protocol 12 analyzer.
# ZKMINER_BIN=/usr/local/bin/zkminer

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Hemi Mainnet (Chain ID: 43111) Contract Promotion Overrides
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per `hemilabs/zk-miner` (`crates/zkminer-chain/src/deployment.rs`), the live
# audited `HemiProve` v2 stack (`zkmarket@c8333aa`) is currently active on
# Hemi Sepolia (`743111`), while Mainnet (`43111`) router deployment is staged.
#
# Leave `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_HEMIPROVE_ROUTER` unset while Mainnet is staged:
#   - UI displays `HEMI MAINNET [43111] | ROUTER: STAGED (PRE-DEPLOYMENT)`
#   - Sepolia addresses are never leaked onto Mainnet explorer links
#   - Verifiers report `RISC0: STAGED`, `SP1: STAGED`, `OPENVM: 743111-ONLY`
#
# Once the Hemi Mainnet v2 Router is deployed, set these variables to promote
# Chain 43111 to `43111-LIVE` automatically without code changes:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_HEMIPROVE_ROUTER=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_HEMIPROVE_STAKING=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_HEMIPROVE_REGISTRY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_PROGRAM_REGISTRY=

# Optional override for Mainnet HEMI ERC-20 token
# (Defaults in `src/lib/hemi-chain.ts` to 0x99e3dE3817F6081B2568208337ef83295b7f591D)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAINNET_HEMI_TOKEN=0x99e3dE3817F6081B2568208337ef83295b7f591D

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
