#   RPC URL:           https://testnet.rpc.hemi.network/rpc
#   Blockscout v2 API: https://testnet.explorer.hemi.xyz/api/v2
#   HemiProveRouter:   0xE1a492Dc6D57fCC2B6deb5B64087E69666cA470e
#   HemiProveStaking:  0x44b2DDCfBe37900917E3750A4996BA007F4aA66E
#   HemiProveRegistry: 0x77fDb1DCE2224B75BA295f2Cdd87Ba5247d4BBc6
#   ProgramRegistry:   0xCC761A929747A81e34517e1f4F98247da925cAb4
#   tHEMI Token:       0x46955EdCF61b23a8c0b0d71428A9F1C07Bbf36cc
#   Scan From Block:   7095745
#
# Hemi Mainnet (43111):
#   RPC URL:           https://rpc.hemi.network/rpc
#   Blockscout v2 API: https://explorer.hemi.xyz/api/v2
#   HEMI Token:        0x99e3dE3817F6081B2568208337ef83295b7f591D

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Security Note on Exported Submitter Scripts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HemiProve Hub NEVER reads or stores wallet private keys in the web app.
# Note: Standalone `viem` scripts exported from `/simulate` read `PRIVATE_KEY`
# from your local shell when executed outside this repository. Do NOT put real
# private keys inside `.env.local` of a web deployment.
